# Netlify _redirects — pretty URLs.
# https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/
#
# Netlify's "Pretty URLs" feature is on by default for deploys, but we
# add explicit 200-rewrites for the canonical short paths the
# security.txt + Responsible Disclosure documents reference. Explicit
# rules guard against a future Netlify config change that flips Pretty
# URLs off.

# Server-side Concierge source is bundled from here, not a public download.
# Force the 404 even when the static publish directory contains the file.
/netlify/*       /404.html              404!

/security        /security.html         200
/status          /status.html           200
/docs            /docs.html             200


# Retired public pages: no rates or implementation explainer remain.
/pricing             /#contact             301!
/pricing/            /#contact             301!
/pricing.html        /#contact             301!
/cctp-explainer      /#the-difference      301!
/cctp-explainer/     /#the-difference      301!
/cctp-explainer.html /#the-difference      301!
